{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026lWmUhSbuwV1792989136.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國佛羅里達州發生槍擊案，最少12人受傷，包括6名小童。暫時未有人被捕。</p><p></p><p>槍擊案發生在周六晚，佛羅里達州塔拉哈西一個欖球場附近。當地警方表示，事發時球賽剛結束，人潮擠擁。初步調查顯示，槍擊前有兩、三人打鬥。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.US.SHOOTING-0300_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20264glyJF8ZbK1792969760.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p>傷者中有11人被槍傷，1人走避時受傷。到周日早上，有5名傷者已出院，仍然留醫傷者中，1人情況危殆。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T05:40:50.178993+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":153,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T23:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T09:18:05.511303+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T05:38:08.465088+00:00","content_hash":"deff59a7f60c9ea20a7ad58ef108936ed2edd7e272f0a1179eab244146952826","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T05:40:50.178993+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}